{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-03-07 07:45:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX AND BRIDGEFORCE DATA SOLUTIONS UNDERSCORE SHARED COMMITMENT TO DATA ACCURACY WITH NEW PARTNERSHIP', 'text': "ATLANTA, MARCH 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) AND FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY FIRM BRIDGEFORCE DATA SOLUTIONS TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW PARTNERSHIP REINFORCING THEIR SHARED COMMITMENT TO THE DATA FURNISHER COMMUNITY BY PROVIDING THEM WITH ADDITIONAL TOOLS AND SUPPORT MECHANISMS TO ENABLE OPTIMAL DATA ACCURACY. AS PART OF THE AGREEMENT, EQUIFAX WILL NOW MAKE BRIDGEFORCE'S INDUSTRY-LEADING DATA QUALITY SCANNER® (DQS) AND COMPREHENSIVE CONSULTING SUPPORT AVAILABLE TO DATA FURNISHERS, PROVIDING A SEAMLESS, INTEGRATED SOLUTION FOR BEST-IN-CLASS CONSUMER REPORTING COMPLIANCE AND DISPUTE MANAGEMENT."}{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-03-07 04:00:00', 'title': 'SIGNIFICANT DROP IN NEW MORTGAGES, CONSUMERS LEANING MORE ON CREDIT CARDS', 'text': 'EQUIFAX CANADA MARKET PULSE QUARTERLY CREDIT TRENDS REPORT EQUIFAX CANADA MARKET PULSE QUARTERLY CREDIT TRENDS REPORT'}